  message: "DONE in PR #2035 (dev 1443c2da57; lab /home/jgstern_agent/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/puvom_11032026/RESULT.md). Decision (a) retire for all four, by reading the commits: 26c72d61d8 moved link_ipc onto _bridge_wrapper_sends / _bridge_function_sends and left detect_context_bridge_wrappers / detect_context_bridge_functions as tuple-shaped views with no caller but their tests; bb18012a37 made extract_svelte_scripts / extract_vue_scripts one-line aliases of _extract_sfc_scripts, which the Svelte and Vue paths call directly. All four deleted; the 12 IPC tests read the same facts through two helpers over the internals, the 9 SFC tests and the attribute-order suite call _extract_sfc_scripts; the examples moved onto the internals' docstrings. Baseline tightened by the textconv_main key (289 -> 288). Behavioural evidence: scripts/check-test-only-reachability on a self map built from the branch tree: before: exit 1, FAIL naming the four (876 test-only-reachable symbols, gated cohort 292); after: exit 0, 'no new test-only-reachable callables' (872 symbols, gated cohort 288 = 288 functions, 0 methods), no symbol with any of the four names, the three internals present (gate_before.txt / gate_after.txt). The methods half is judged only on the cron's scip-python map: the next full-suite run (01:00 / 13:00 UTC) is the final evidence; if it names anything else, that is a new item, not this one reopened."  # 36b6
